ADDITIONAL NOTICE — NOT A MEDICAL DEVICE

This software provides mental health screening questionnaires and educational
information only. It does not provide medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment,
and it is not a substitute for consultation with a qualified health
professional. Anyone deploying, modifying, or redistributing it must retain the
in-app disclaimers and crisis helpline information.

The screening instruments themselves (PHQ-4, PHQ-9, GAD-7 — Kroenke, Spitzer &
Williams; AUDIT-C — derived from the WHO AUDIT) are in the public domain and
are not covered by the copyright above. Indian-language translations of the
instrument items included here are working translations for accessibility and
are not the officially validated language versions; officially validated
translations should be used for research or formal clinical work.
